     2→ * SSE Stream Service
     3→ *
     4→ * Manages Server-Sent Events (SSE) connections for real-time project updates.
     5→ * Allows Dashboard to subscribe to project state changes without polling.
     6→ *
     7→ * Features:
     8→ * - Project-specific event streaming
